The trust is a list of 1, 3, 2, and 3.
The scores is a list of 4 zeros.
For every pair from 0 to 1.
The giver is item (pair times 2) of trust.
The taker is item (pair times 2 plus 1) of trust.
Set item giver of scores to item giver of scores minus 1.
Set item taker of scores to item taker of scores plus 1.

The judge is -1.
For every person from 1 to 3.
If item person of scores is 2, set judge to person.

Show judge.
